        "subject": "=RFQ: {{ $json.materialName }} - {{ $json.projectName }}",
        "message": "=<h2>Request for Quotation</h2>\n<p>Dear {{ $json.vendorName }},</p>\n<p>We would like to request a quotation for the following:</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\">\n<tr><td><strong>RFQ ID:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.rfqId }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Material:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.materialName }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Quantity:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.quantity }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Budget:</strong></td><td>${{ $json.budget }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Deadline:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.deadline }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Project:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.projectName }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Urgency:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.urgency }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>Please provide your quotation including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unit price</li>\n<li>Total cost</li>\n<li>Delivery time</li>\n<li>Payment terms</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Best regards,<br>Procurement Team</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
